Surah 90–114 (Balad → Nas)
The final group contains short, powerful surahs focused on the human soul, sincerity, accountability, and pure belief in Allah. The message becomes simple and direct: success depends on faith, righteousness, patience, and protection from evil influences.

Logic:
After knowledge and warning, the heart must choose.

